    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be the solution of the differential equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.&nbsp;If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
